1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:03,526
Keep your timer close, without keeping the main window open.

2
00:00:04,387 --> 00:00:12,425
Choose Atlas in Overview and start your session. The mini timer follows this same session; it does not create a second timer.

3
00:00:13,487 --> 00:00:21,637
Click Mini timer. On desktop, the compact window stays above ordinary windows and can be moved to a useful corner.

4
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:29,484
Pause for a break, then resume from the compact window. The paused time is excluded from your working time.

5
00:00:30,553 --> 00:00:37,058
Use the stop button to finish and save. Closing a window only hides it; it does not finish your session.

6
00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:42,387
One timer. The same project. Always finish when the work is done.
